Suitable Cases
Banking systems
Admin dashboards
ABAC (Attribute-Based Access Control)
Explanation

Permissions based on attributes like department, location, or time.

Suitable Cases
Government systems
Enterprise security systems
ACL (Access Control List)
Explanation

Each resource maintains list of user permissions.

Suitable Cases
File sharing systems
Cloud storage
